WEBVTT

00:00:02.410 --> 00:00:04.410
<i>A rose which blooms</i>

00:00:02.410 --> 00:00:04.410
<i>once every decade...</i>

00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:11.950
<i>That incident ten years ago</i>

00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:11.950
<i>is the start of my existence.</i>

00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:16.160
<i>Kaname is...my...</i>

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:22.790
<i>But why was he there?</i>

00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:27.290
<i>Who took away my memory?</i>

00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:34.580
<i>If I learned the truth...</i>

00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:34.580
<i>what would happen?</i>

00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:37.080
<i>I'm scared.</i>

00:00:38.370 --> 00:00:40.830
<i>But I must find out.</i>

00:00:53.080 --> 00:00:55.080
<i>What was that just now?!</i>

00:02:38.330 --> 00:02:41.750
THE SUBORDINATE'S TRAP

00:02:41.830 --> 00:02:43.290
Thank you for today!

00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:46.200
Good work!

00:02:47.910 --> 00:02:48.910
See you tomorrow!

00:02:49.950 --> 00:02:51.120
<i>They're going to eat me...</i>

00:02:55.660 --> 00:02:56.660
See you later.

00:02:56.910 --> 00:02:58.160
Oh, all right.

00:03:12.410 --> 00:03:14.250
<i>The scary vampire is...</i>

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:15.910
<i>...going to...</i>

00:03:21.330 --> 00:03:24.410
Now I've done it!

00:03:21.330 --> 00:03:24.410
The rose tea we got as a gift...

00:03:24.830 --> 00:03:27.950
Oh, Kiryu, would you like some?

00:03:24.830 --> 00:03:27.950
It's from Kaname.

00:03:28.200 --> 00:03:29.200
No thanks.

00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:30.660
With the exception

00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:30.660
of two students,

00:03:30.750 --> 00:03:32.830
everyone from Night Class

00:03:30.750 --> 00:03:32.830
have returned to their dorm.

00:03:33.910 --> 00:03:36.250
I just came to make that report. 'Night.

00:03:36.330 --> 00:03:39.700
Oww! I cut my finger!

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:43.660
It's a shame to waste it.

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:43.660
Want to lick, Kiryu?

00:03:44.830 --> 00:03:47.830
Please don't do the same thing

00:03:44.830 --> 00:03:47.830
your daughter does to me.

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:51.410
What? What do you mean?

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:51.410
Did you lick Yuki's blood then?

00:03:53.830 --> 00:03:55.000
You already know.

00:03:55.330 --> 00:03:56.330
Huh?

00:03:56.410 --> 00:03:58.790
That even now I...

00:03:56.410 --> 00:03:58.790
Yuki's blood...

00:04:00.700 --> 00:04:04.830
Well...I've watched you

00:04:00.700 --> 00:04:04.830
over the years.

00:04:05.910 --> 00:04:09.500
But I know you both agonized over

00:04:05.910 --> 00:04:09.500
what to do before choosing this path.

00:04:10.330 --> 00:04:12.160
Right now, I just want to

00:04:10.330 --> 00:04:12.160
watch over you.

00:04:12.830 --> 00:04:15.080
Even if it's something

00:04:12.830 --> 00:04:15.080
that's taboo for humans.

00:04:16.200 --> 00:04:17.200
Am I being irresponsible?

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:21.120
I think it's okay as long as

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:21.120
you're still yourself.

00:04:28.450 --> 00:04:31.830
Oh, w-wait!

00:04:28.450 --> 00:04:31.830
There's something important that...

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:34.540
There's a student who wants to

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:34.540
transfer to Day Class.

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:39.330
I cannot let him in unless

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:39.330
I get your approval first.

00:04:54.660 --> 00:04:58.330
<i>The blood is an illusion...</i>

00:04:54.660 --> 00:04:58.330
<i>It's just an illusion.</i>

00:04:58.910 --> 00:05:00.250
<i>You think so?</i>

00:05:02.250 --> 00:05:03.700
<i>You always...</i>

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:05.000
No.

00:05:05.120 --> 00:05:06.450
<i>Just like that...</i>

00:05:06.750 --> 00:05:07.750
<i>Stop...</i>

00:05:07.830 --> 00:05:10.660
<i>...hurt something...</i>

00:05:07.830 --> 00:05:10.660
<i>precious to you.</i>

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:19.000
Yuki...

00:05:19.620 --> 00:05:21.330
Oh...Kaname...

00:05:26.620 --> 00:05:31.160
What are you so afraid of?

00:05:26.620 --> 00:05:31.160
Calm down, Yuki.

00:05:36.200 --> 00:05:38.330
I'm...sorry...

00:05:39.330 --> 00:05:42.750
I'm sorry, Kaname.

00:05:43.700 --> 00:05:46.250
It's all right. It's all right.

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:48.450
I'm sorry.

00:05:49.790 --> 00:05:55.160
<i>What am I...doing? How could I point</i>

00:05:49.790 --> 00:05:55.160
<i>my rod at him for even an instant?</i>

00:05:56.950 --> 00:06:00.830
Yuki... What was it that you couldn't

00:05:56.950 --> 00:06:00.830
talk about in front of the others?

00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:07.080
I wanted to ask...you something.

00:06:08.910 --> 00:06:12.160
Kaname...why were you there

00:06:08.910 --> 00:06:12.160
on that snowy day?

00:06:15.620 --> 00:06:17.910
Did you actually...

00:06:19.500 --> 00:06:25.750
It's all right. Whatever you ask, it won't

00:06:19.500 --> 00:06:25.750
change the way I feel towards you.

00:06:26.160 --> 00:06:27.160
Oh...

00:06:27.250 --> 00:06:31.910
I've never come right out and told you...

00:06:27.250 --> 00:06:31.910
But you understand, don't you, Yuki?

00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:36.580
I love you.

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:42.540
More than anything in the world...

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:42.540
if I could,

00:06:42.620 --> 00:06:46.080
I would take away all your worries.

00:06:49.410 --> 00:06:50.750
What's the matter, Yuki?!

00:06:52.040 --> 00:06:53.040
I couldn't...

00:06:54.200 --> 00:06:55.830
When I face Kaname...

00:06:56.830 --> 00:07:01.040
I just couldn't find the words.

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:03.250
Yuki...

00:07:07.910 --> 00:07:09.200
Don't be hasty.

00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:12.660
There will come a time

00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:12.660
when you can ask him.

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:14.500
So...okay?

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:17.370
Uh-huh...

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:25.250
Why have you come at such an hour?

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:25.250
Please leave.

00:07:25.700 --> 00:07:27.160
What is it, Seiren?

00:07:28.120 --> 00:07:29.120
Lord Kaname...

00:07:30.500 --> 00:07:34.450
I sensed something distasteful...

00:07:30.500 --> 00:07:34.450
So it was you.

00:07:36.120 --> 00:07:37.830
Come in. Make yourself at home.

00:07:43.330 --> 00:07:46.950
Are you the one who erased

00:07:43.330 --> 00:07:46.950
Yuki's memory or not?

00:07:47.660 --> 00:07:51.120
Are you involved in

00:07:47.660 --> 00:07:51.120
Yuki's past or not?

00:07:52.540 --> 00:07:55.450
Do you want to erase

00:07:52.540 --> 00:07:55.450
Yuki's anxiety or not?

00:07:57.290 --> 00:08:03.290
Then...why don't I crush

00:07:57.290 --> 00:08:03.290
one of her anxieties right now!

00:08:08.120 --> 00:08:12.620
Try it. When you do,

00:08:08.120 --> 00:08:12.620
I'd have the opening...to shoot you.

00:08:14.830 --> 00:08:16.040
You amaze me...

00:08:16.410 --> 00:08:21.160
Vampires instinctively fear

00:08:16.410 --> 00:08:21.160
and respect a Pureblood.

00:08:21.700 --> 00:08:24.040
Yet you dare to

00:08:21.700 --> 00:08:24.040
bare your fangs at me.

00:08:24.620 --> 00:08:27.250
I really...detest you.

00:08:32.540 --> 00:08:35.450
But you have no intention

00:08:32.540 --> 00:08:35.450
of killing me...

00:08:36.620 --> 00:08:40.450
If I killed you before

00:08:36.620 --> 00:08:40.450
I get the truth out of you,

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:42.870
Yuki would be so sad.

00:08:44.660 --> 00:08:46.040
The body is so obedient...

00:08:46.330 --> 00:08:48.700
It saw blood and now,

00:08:46.330 --> 00:08:48.700
your eyes are crying out for it.

00:08:51.330 --> 00:08:53.000
I can smell Yuki on you...

00:08:53.830 --> 00:08:57.410
You're such an ungrateful Level E.

00:08:59.750 --> 00:09:01.500
If you lose that much blood...

00:09:02.160 --> 00:09:04.580
You would not be able

00:09:02.160 --> 00:09:04.580
to resist the hunger.

00:09:06.620 --> 00:09:08.120
Listen...Zero.

00:09:08.830 --> 00:09:11.500
Feed on my blood again.

00:09:12.910 --> 00:09:16.790
Do you think that in my right mind,

00:09:12.910 --> 00:09:16.790
I'd accept blood from you?

00:09:17.290 --> 00:09:19.450
I can't have you dropping dead here.

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:25.580
I've allowed you to live until now,

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:25.580
so that you can be useful to Yuki.

00:09:26.330 --> 00:09:29.620
Because I know that

00:09:26.330 --> 00:09:29.620
you would never betray her.

00:09:30.200 --> 00:09:32.000
You're always so arbitrary.

00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:33.200
I know.

00:09:33.950 --> 00:09:38.580
You and I probably have

00:09:33.950 --> 00:09:38.580
the same feelings for Yuki.

00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:45.160
I-I just want Yuki to be able to

00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:45.160
smile from her heart.

00:09:45.910 --> 00:09:46.910
So do I.

00:09:48.500 --> 00:09:53.950
There's no need for her to

00:09:48.500 --> 00:09:53.950
sacrifice herself...none at all.

00:09:54.500 --> 00:09:55.830
You're absolutely right.

00:10:12.540 --> 00:10:18.000
Never forget...

00:10:12.540 --> 00:10:18.000
by whom this blood was offered.

00:10:22.410 --> 00:10:23.410
Halt!

00:10:26.830 --> 00:10:27.830
You...

00:10:31.120 --> 00:10:33.500
<i>It would be wise not to</i>

00:10:31.120 --> 00:10:33.500
<i>delve any further than this.</i>

00:10:34.500 --> 00:10:37.160
But you...can "delve further"

00:10:34.500 --> 00:10:37.160
with Lord Kaname...

00:10:38.790 --> 00:10:42.120
...to the part,

00:10:38.790 --> 00:10:42.120
which he hides in darkness.

00:10:42.910 --> 00:10:44.120
Aido...?

00:10:44.450 --> 00:10:45.450
Go quickly...

00:10:45.660 --> 00:10:49.660
The Night Class has sensed...

00:10:45.660 --> 00:10:49.660
that Lord Kaname's blood flowed.

00:10:52.620 --> 00:10:55.290
<i>Kuran Kaname...the part that</i>

00:10:52.620 --> 00:10:55.290
<i>he hides in darkness?</i>

00:10:56.830 --> 00:10:59.040
<i>That's Yuki's...</i>

00:11:08.660 --> 00:11:10.660
Fulfill your duties well,

00:11:11.120 --> 00:11:15.580
if you seek my Lord's help

00:11:11.120 --> 00:11:15.580
for your revenge.

00:11:16.830 --> 00:11:17.830
Yes.

00:11:24.080 --> 00:11:29.790
Are you okay, Yuki? I'm going to ask

00:11:24.080 --> 00:11:29.790
the academy doctor stop by later.

00:11:38.040 --> 00:11:42.580
<i>I couldn't think...</i>

00:11:38.040 --> 00:11:42.580
<i>and I couldn't answer.</i>

00:11:43.330 --> 00:11:44.450
<i>I love you...</i>

00:11:46.910 --> 00:11:49.200
<i>The age where I didn't know</i>

00:11:46.910 --> 00:11:49.200
<i>anything has passed.</i>

00:11:50.700 --> 00:11:57.700
<i>Now I try hard not to think about it.</i>

00:11:50.700 --> 00:11:57.700
<i>About Kaname and myself.</i>

00:11:59.660 --> 00:12:01.250
<i>I thought I shouldn't think...</i>

00:12:02.080 --> 00:12:05.250
<i>I've never come right out and told you...</i>

00:12:02.080 --> 00:12:05.250
<i>But you understand, don't you?</i>

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:11.200
<i>I understand...</i>

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:11.200
<i>I'm afraid to know the answer.</i>

00:12:13.700 --> 00:12:18.330
Everyone, be quiet!

00:12:13.700 --> 00:12:18.330
Now, introduce yourself.

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:22.750
Hello. I'm a new student

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:22.750
from this semester.

00:12:27.830 --> 00:12:29.660
<i>Zero's not here?</i>

00:12:35.750 --> 00:12:38.620
Yuki? Is your migraine gone?

00:12:38.700 --> 00:12:42.540
I'm fine, thanks.

00:12:38.700 --> 00:12:42.540
But what's going on?

00:12:42.910 --> 00:12:43.910
That.

00:12:44.910 --> 00:12:48.290
Due to certain circumstances,

00:12:44.910 --> 00:12:48.290
my older brother and I lived apart.

00:12:48.790 --> 00:12:52.450
I'm the younger twin, Ichiru Kiryu.

00:12:48.790 --> 00:12:52.450
Nice to meet you all.

00:12:53.330 --> 00:12:54.370
Cross!

00:12:54.450 --> 00:12:56.410
Hurry and sit down!

00:12:57.830 --> 00:13:00.620
Class President, please help him out

00:12:57.830 --> 00:13:00.620
until he's used to things.

00:13:00.700 --> 00:13:01.700
O-Okay...

00:13:02.620 --> 00:13:04.450
<i>Revenge...is what he's here for.</i>

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:08.160
<i>He thinks that it was Zero</i>

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:08.160
<i>who stabbed Shizuka to death.</i>

00:13:08.830 --> 00:13:10.950
<i>Why...Why did the Headmaster...?</i>

00:13:13.120 --> 00:13:15.620
Zero...used to have good taste.

00:13:17.000 --> 00:13:19.330
I can't imagine why

00:13:17.000 --> 00:13:19.330
he thinks you're so precious.

00:13:19.830 --> 00:13:20.830
Huh...?

00:13:20.910 --> 00:13:22.700
He's an acquaintance?

00:13:22.790 --> 00:13:24.830
Huh? Well...sort of.

00:13:25.410 --> 00:13:28.120
He seems more disagreeable

00:13:25.410 --> 00:13:28.120
than Kiryu Number One.

00:13:28.410 --> 00:13:29.410
You're absolutely right.

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:33.500
Number One cherishes you,

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:33.500
doesn't he?

00:13:39.200 --> 00:13:40.330
You insist...on going?

00:13:40.750 --> 00:13:42.500
Yeah. Thanks for putting me up.

00:13:43.500 --> 00:13:44.500
Huh?

00:13:44.580 --> 00:13:47.450
I'll be lonely. Stay here!

00:13:49.250 --> 00:13:51.370
Why did you admit

00:13:49.250 --> 00:13:51.370
Ichiru to this school?

00:13:54.410 --> 00:13:56.870
Now, when we don't know what

00:13:54.410 --> 00:13:56.870
the Hunter's Society is thinking,

00:13:56.950 --> 00:14:00.620
we cannot avoid contact

00:13:56.950 --> 00:14:00.620
between Zero and Ichiru.

00:14:01.410 --> 00:14:05.910
Whether it's outside of school or inside.

00:14:01.410 --> 00:14:05.910
We can't avoid it.

00:14:06.500 --> 00:14:09.500
Then perhaps,

00:14:06.500 --> 00:14:09.500
if they stay close,

00:14:09.580 --> 00:14:11.450
they may come to

00:14:09.580 --> 00:14:11.450
understand each other someday.

00:14:13.870 --> 00:14:16.500
All right, I understand how you feel.

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:20.410
So let's stay close too.

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:20.410
All right?

00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:21.500
Get away!

00:14:21.910 --> 00:14:24.830
I'm going to look into

00:14:21.910 --> 00:14:24.830
the Society in my own way.

00:14:25.660 --> 00:14:26.660
However...

00:14:27.120 --> 00:14:28.450
I don't object to you.

00:14:29.410 --> 00:14:30.410
Yagari?

00:14:30.500 --> 00:14:31.500
See you.

00:14:31.830 --> 00:14:32.830
Ouch!

00:14:33.750 --> 00:14:34.750
Hello...

00:14:34.830 --> 00:14:35.830
Yuki!

00:14:36.910 --> 00:14:37.910
Umm...

00:14:38.330 --> 00:14:40.080
See you, missy.

00:14:40.660 --> 00:14:41.660
Oh...

00:14:41.910 --> 00:14:42.910
Did you overhear us?

00:14:43.000 --> 00:14:45.330
No... Well, a little.

00:14:45.790 --> 00:14:49.660
Kiryu agreed to it...

00:14:45.790 --> 00:14:49.660
Ichiru's transfer.

00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:51.000
Zero did?

00:14:51.080 --> 00:14:55.330
Mm-hmm... Kiryu has a scary look

00:14:51.080 --> 00:14:55.330
and gets upset so quickly,

00:14:55.410 --> 00:14:56.830
but he's being quite adult about it.

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:02.750
You're identical twins, right?

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:02.750
Don't you match each other?

00:15:02.830 --> 00:15:03.950
Like your hairstyle?

00:15:04.410 --> 00:15:08.750
Would you have been happier if we did?

00:15:04.410 --> 00:15:08.750
Maybe I'll cut my hair.

00:15:09.120 --> 00:15:11.250
Can you? That easily?

00:15:11.540 --> 00:15:15.120
You're so sociable, Ichiru.

00:15:11.540 --> 00:15:15.120
Unlike Kiryu.

00:15:15.500 --> 00:15:19.410
You're the hope of the Day Class!

00:15:15.500 --> 00:15:19.410
The other boys are hopeless.

00:15:19.500 --> 00:15:20.500
What did you say?!

00:15:21.200 --> 00:15:22.500
Oh... class president...

00:15:22.700 --> 00:15:23.950
Wh-What?!

00:15:24.250 --> 00:15:28.500
I don't know anything about this place.

00:15:24.250 --> 00:15:28.500
So can I rely on you?

00:15:28.790 --> 00:15:34.500
S-Sure. If there's anything

00:15:28.790 --> 00:15:34.500
you don't know, just ask me.

00:15:34.870 --> 00:15:37.500
You're way more likable

00:15:34.870 --> 00:15:37.500
than your brother.

00:15:37.580 --> 00:15:38.620
- Oh...!

00:15:37.580 --> 00:15:38.620
- Oh...!

00:15:42.330 --> 00:15:44.080
I-I didn't mean...!

00:15:44.160 --> 00:15:45.290
Please excuse me.

00:15:47.580 --> 00:15:51.370
What is it? You look so threatening,

00:15:47.580 --> 00:15:51.370
you scared them all.

00:15:52.250 --> 00:15:54.620
If you're here for revenge,

00:15:52.250 --> 00:15:54.620
get on with it.

00:15:55.200 --> 00:15:58.330
What? You didn't

00:15:55.200 --> 00:15:58.330
agree to my transfer

00:15:58.410 --> 00:16:01.950
so that you could console

00:15:58.410 --> 00:16:01.950
your sad little brother?

00:16:02.500 --> 00:16:04.160
You mentioned "Cursed Twins,"

00:16:02.500 --> 00:16:04.160
didn't you?

00:16:04.540 --> 00:16:05.540
What does that mean?

00:16:05.790 --> 00:16:11.660
I dunno... Just that twins born into

00:16:05.790 --> 00:16:11.660
vampire hunter families are called that.

00:16:12.290 --> 00:16:16.750
It's perfect, don't you think?

00:16:12.290 --> 00:16:16.750
A name like the Cursed Twins for us.

00:16:18.290 --> 00:16:21.950
I wanted to experience being

00:16:18.290 --> 00:16:21.950
an average high school student too.

00:16:23.330 --> 00:16:24.620
It's not fair you're the only one

00:16:23.330 --> 00:16:24.620
who gets to do it, Zero.

00:16:33.120 --> 00:16:34.160
I finished reporting in.

00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:37.000
Right.

00:16:37.620 --> 00:16:40.000
Zero... You were speaking to Ichiru.

00:16:40.410 --> 00:16:41.410
You were watching?

00:16:41.620 --> 00:16:42.620
I was.

00:16:42.700 --> 00:16:44.620
I was watching...in total awe.

00:16:45.620 --> 00:16:51.120
You're trying to meet Ichiru half way.

00:16:45.620 --> 00:16:51.120
You're facing your past.

00:16:52.790 --> 00:16:54.660
You're incredible.

00:16:55.000 --> 00:16:56.000
I told you.

00:16:57.080 --> 00:16:58.580
You don't have to worry.

00:16:59.160 --> 00:17:00.160
<i>Never forget...</i>

00:17:00.620 --> 00:17:03.000
<i>...by whom this blood was offered.</i>

00:17:03.870 --> 00:17:04.870
You...

00:17:04.950 --> 00:17:08.700
No, I'm going to face up to Kaname.

00:17:09.870 --> 00:17:11.120
For just over ten years...

00:17:11.450 --> 00:17:14.580
Kaname and I have spent

00:17:11.450 --> 00:17:14.580
time together and deepened our ties.

00:17:15.200 --> 00:17:19.870
I even thought that, with him,

00:17:15.200 --> 00:17:19.870
I wouldn't mind being betrayed.

00:17:20.620 --> 00:17:23.080
But, ultimately, I was scared.

00:17:23.410 --> 00:17:25.500
It took a lot of time

00:17:23.410 --> 00:17:25.500
to get to this point.

00:17:26.540 --> 00:17:28.620
Especially after I

00:17:26.540 --> 00:17:28.620
acted so brave with you.

00:17:29.870 --> 00:17:34.160
I...I've loved Kaname

00:17:29.870 --> 00:17:34.160
since ten years ago.

00:17:35.290 --> 00:17:36.290
Why tell me now?

00:17:37.620 --> 00:17:41.620
I know. Kaname is hiding something.

00:17:43.620 --> 00:17:44.620
But still...

00:17:46.330 --> 00:17:47.330
I have to go.

00:17:58.660 --> 00:17:59.660
Never mind...

00:18:01.330 --> 00:18:02.330
Just go.

00:18:03.750 --> 00:18:04.750
Uh-huh...

00:18:09.950 --> 00:18:12.000
<i>When I first opened my eyes...</i>

00:18:12.080 --> 00:18:16.040
<i>the world around me,</i>

00:18:12.080 --> 00:18:16.040
<i>and inside my head, was pure white.</i>

00:18:17.790 --> 00:18:21.790
<i>But your mere existence...</i>

00:18:17.790 --> 00:18:21.790
<i>colored my world instantly.</i>

00:18:24.410 --> 00:18:25.450
Yuki.

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:26.540
Huh?

00:18:26.620 --> 00:18:27.620
I've been waiting for you.

00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:33.410
<i>Please tell me the truth.</i>

00:18:34.700 --> 00:18:38.040
<i>I don't want to remain a child</i>

00:18:34.700 --> 00:18:38.040
<i>who's not allowed to know anything.</i>

00:18:40.620 --> 00:18:41.620
What is it?

00:18:41.700 --> 00:18:45.080
Please tell me the truth.

00:18:41.700 --> 00:18:45.080
This time without evading me.

00:18:45.450 --> 00:18:50.000
Evade? Oh...

00:18:45.450 --> 00:18:50.000
You mean when I said I love you?

00:18:52.870 --> 00:18:54.500
Y-Yes...

00:18:55.500 --> 00:18:58.250
I was serious.

00:18:55.500 --> 00:18:58.250
Was that disagreeable to you?

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:01.910
Disagreeable? Oh, no way!

00:19:02.290 --> 00:19:05.160
I've loved you for so long...

00:19:02.290 --> 00:19:05.160
even now...!

00:19:06.290 --> 00:19:08.790
<i>The time you spent with me...</i>

00:19:09.700 --> 00:19:10.700
<i>Yuki!</i>

00:19:11.450 --> 00:19:12.540
<i>Lord Kaname...</i>

00:19:14.000 --> 00:19:17.160
<i>Those arms I could throw myself</i>

00:19:14.000 --> 00:19:17.160
<i>into with such ease...</i>

00:19:18.000 --> 00:19:22.040
<i>That beautiful person who was kind</i>

00:19:18.000 --> 00:19:22.040
<i>and looked only at me...</i>

00:19:23.160 --> 00:19:24.540
<i>Those moments were my salvation.</i>

00:19:26.000 --> 00:19:30.000
There's absolutely no reason

00:19:26.000 --> 00:19:30.000
why I would dislike you.

00:19:30.910 --> 00:19:36.000
Even if you were the same vampire

00:19:30.910 --> 00:19:36.000
that once tried to feed upon me...

00:19:36.870 --> 00:19:38.540
It's because of your existence,

00:19:36.870 --> 00:19:38.540
Lord Kaname, that I...

00:19:43.160 --> 00:19:44.160
Yuki...?

00:19:44.450 --> 00:19:45.790
Why does it have to be me?

00:19:46.660 --> 00:19:48.290
Even I have realized already...

00:19:49.120 --> 00:19:51.160
No matter how hard

00:19:49.120 --> 00:19:51.160
I try to reach up to you...

00:19:51.250 --> 00:19:54.000
I'm not someone who suits you.

00:19:54.660 --> 00:19:59.790
Kaname, you have something

00:19:54.660 --> 00:19:59.790
to do with the past I lost, don't you?

00:20:07.620 --> 00:20:08.620
Is it true?

00:20:08.910 --> 00:20:13.040
Then why don't you tell me?!

00:20:08.910 --> 00:20:13.040
Please tell me the truth.

00:20:13.290 --> 00:20:15.410
I cannot stay like this!

00:20:15.950 --> 00:20:18.580
I won't use our bond as an escape.

00:20:18.870 --> 00:20:22.040
I want to know and become strong!

00:20:18.870 --> 00:20:22.040
Please!

00:20:24.580 --> 00:20:25.580
You're so silly...

00:20:26.790 --> 00:20:30.080
You should stay here in

00:20:26.790 --> 00:20:30.080
this miniature garden

00:20:30.160 --> 00:20:31.830
and be happy,

00:20:30.160 --> 00:20:31.830
even if for a little longer.

00:20:33.620 --> 00:20:37.750
Are you sure? Even if the hidden truth

00:20:33.620 --> 00:20:37.750
is covered in bloodshed?

00:20:38.750 --> 00:20:39.830
You still want to know?

00:20:40.620 --> 00:20:42.500
Yes, Kaname...

00:20:44.660 --> 00:20:48.040
I have been afraid...

00:20:48.120 --> 00:20:51.040
that if the one person

00:20:48.120 --> 00:20:51.040
who gives me warmth...

00:20:51.120 --> 00:20:53.540
if you...learned the truth...

00:20:53.620 --> 00:20:56.790
You might come to hate me.

00:20:59.120 --> 00:21:01.950
No... I would never hate you.

00:21:02.450 --> 00:21:05.330
Then, prove it to me...

00:21:06.450 --> 00:21:08.790
Become my lover.

00:21:12.540 --> 00:21:16.870
Her arm was so delicate...

00:21:18.620 --> 00:21:22.040
<i>Don't go, Yuki.</i>

00:21:18.620 --> 00:21:22.040
<i>You don't need to know.</i>

00:21:24.000 --> 00:21:26.790
<i>If you know...you...</i>

00:21:33.160 --> 00:21:37.750
No...let go. You think I'll back off

00:21:33.160 --> 00:21:37.750
if you say that to me!

00:21:38.200 --> 00:21:40.700
I don't want you to evade

00:21:38.200 --> 00:21:40.700
my questions anymore!

00:21:40.790 --> 00:21:41.790
Yuki...

00:21:42.450 --> 00:21:47.540
Because you faced me straight on,

00:21:42.450 --> 00:21:47.540
I am being serious to you.

00:21:48.080 --> 00:21:49.080
Liar...

00:21:49.160 --> 00:21:51.950
I'm not lying. So Yuki...

00:21:52.660 --> 00:21:54.910
If you want to know,

00:21:52.660 --> 00:21:54.910
you should listen to me.

00:21:57.000 --> 00:21:58.000
<i>Why?</i>

00:22:00.700 --> 00:22:01.700
Good girl...

00:22:03.200 --> 00:22:07.290
<i>Why? Like this...</i>

00:22:03.200 --> 00:22:07.290
<i>Kaname...</i>

00:22:09.160 --> 00:22:11.870
You can stop looking

00:22:09.160 --> 00:22:11.870
with such sad eyes.

00:22:14.330 --> 00:22:21.000
From now on, I will cherish

00:22:14.330 --> 00:22:21.000
and protect Yuki...as my lover.

00:23:58.950 --> 00:24:03.950
Next time:

00:23:58.950 --> 00:24:03.950
"The Fake Lovers"
